# Step Between Worlds: "Each player may shuffle their hand and graveyard into their library. Each player who does draws seven cards. Exile Step Between Worlds." Bot1 shuffles (its Island hand and its Black Lotus in the graveyard go into the library) and draws seven; Bot2 declines, so it keeps its Forests in hand and its Lightning Bolt in the graveyard and draws nothing. The spell is exiled, not shuffled in.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Step Between Worlds
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Forest x30

